<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_960_2877.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser früntlich willig dienst, sampt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir eeren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> vermögen zuovoran, from <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/>sichtig ersam wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gäthriüw</unclear> lieb eidtgnossen. Es ist vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>der edel vest, unnser lieber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonnder</unclear> David <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buetten</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ser</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erichtsherr</unclear> zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Sonnenberg</placeName>, unnd azeigt, dem-
<lb n="7"/>nach sin bruoder <persName resp="#ner">Thoman Buettenser</persName>, sich ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyttlanng</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herzogen</unclear> zuo <placeName resp="#ner">Zweybrucken</placeName> enthaltenn,
<lb n="9"/>unnd daselbs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemüntzt</unclear>, derselbig sye nun von ge-
<lb n="10"/>dachtem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herzogen</unclear>, alls <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellte</unclear> er nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rächt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmüntzt</unclear> haben,
<lb n="11"/>gefencklich ynzogen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> fünff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thusend</unclear> guldin
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobezalen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufferlegt</unclear> worden. Unnd wiewol gemelter
<lb n="13"/>sin bruoder, damit er söllicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hertten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefenncknuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlediget</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/>werden möchte, dritthalb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thusend</unclear> guldin, die er anfencklich
<lb n="15"/>alls er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuomüntzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angestannden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herzogen</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vortzelaehen</unclear> versprochen. Sye er wol der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfenncknuß</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlassen</unclear>, aber doch uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glüpt</unclear>, daß er nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abträtten</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>biß er noch, dritthalb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thusend</unclear> guldin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlegge</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffgehallten</unclear>.
<lb n="19"/>Deßhalb er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> gantz früntlich umb fürgeschrifft an üch an
<lb n="20"/>gruoefft unnd gepätenn, wir welltenn ime unb sovyl
<lb n="21"/>gegen üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befüruerlich</unclear> sin, diewyl er by üch burger,
<lb n="22"/>daß ir so wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> unnd üweren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitrath</unclear> unnd paner
<lb n="23"/>herren, juncker <persName resp="#ner">Lienhart Keller</persName>, dahin vermögen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welten</unclear>,
<lb n="24"/>damit er zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelägner</unclear> zyt, zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemältem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrenn</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herzogen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rytten</unclear>, unnd mit ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wägenn</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachts</unclear> sins bruoders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hanndlen</unclear> wellte. So nun
<lb n="27"/>wir gemelten <persName resp="#ner">David <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buettenser</unclear></persName>, inn sinem anbring
<lb n="28"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begären</unclear> verstannden, so gelanngt an üch unser
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ganntz</unclear> früntlich, unnd eidtgnößisch pitt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begären</unclear>, ir
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsertwägen</unclear> so guotwillig sin, unnd
